  "full-article-text": "<p id=\"\">If you wish to unstake, i.e. convert your <a id=\"\" href=\"http://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-is-a-liquid-stake-unit-lsu-and-native-liquid-staking\"><strong id=\"\">Liquid Stake Unit (LSU)</strong></a> tokens to claim back the underlying <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-is-the-xrd-token\"><strong id=\"\">XRD</strong></a> held inside a <a id=\"\" href=\"http://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-is-a-validator-component\"><strong id=\"\">validator component’s</strong></a> staked pool, you must wait 2,016 <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/how-long-is-an-epoch-on-radix\"><strong id=\"\">epochs</strong></a> (approximately 7 days) for the underlying XRD to be unstaked.</p><p id=\"\">If you are a <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-is-a-validator-node\"><strong id=\"\">validator</strong></a> node-runner and have locked your LSUs as owner stake, then the unstake period is 8,064 epochs, or approximately 28 days.&nbsp;</p><p id=\"\">To learn how this works, see <a id=\"\" href=\"http://learn.radixdlt.com/article/how-does-staking-work-on-radix\"><strong id=\"\">How does staking work on Radix?</strong></a> and <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/how-to-stake-and-unstake-xrd\"><strong id=\"\">How to Stake and Unstake XRD</strong></a><strong id=\"\">.</strong></p><p id=\"\">‍<strong id=\"\">Further Reading:</strong></p><ul id=\"\"><li id=\"\"><a id=\"\" href=\"http://learn.radixdlt.com/article/what-is-a-liquid-stake-unit-lsu-and-native-liquid-staking\"><strong id=\"\">What is a Liquid Stake Unit (LSU) and Native Liquid Staking?</strong></a></li><li id=\"\"><a id=\"\" href=\"http://learn.radixdlt.com/article/how-does-staking-work-on-radix\"><strong id=\"\">How does staking work on Radix?</strong></a></li><li id=\"\"><a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/how-long-is-an-epoch-on-radix\"><strong id=\"\">How long is an epoch on Radix?</strong></a></li><li id=\"\"><a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/how-to-stake-and-unstake-xrd\"><strong id=\"\">How to Stake and Unstake XRD</strong></a></li></ul><p id=\"\">‍</p>",
